The multitask regression head records its adaptation from the ChemBERTa
regression implementation. The IBM materials SELFIES tokenizer is an external
Apache-2.0 asset.

ApexOracle-specific modifications parameterize data and model paths, fix
tokenizer revisions, and add validation tools. See README.md for usage.
